Backport of CachyOS/linux 962bee17a9d7d5cd3369b70c0914fe050b66b948 (7.3/cachy),
which is not in the cachyos-7.3.1-1 tag. Drop once a CachyOS release tag
carries it. Requires the pahole merged-CU fixes from dev-util/pahole-1.32-r1.
https://github.com/CachyOS/linux/commit/962bee17a9d7d5cd3369b70c0914fe050b66b948

From 962bee17a9d7d5cd3369b70c0914fe050b66b948 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peter Jung <admin@ptr1337.dev>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 11:31:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rust: Allow BTF generation with Rust + LTO

Commit 5daa0c35a1f0 ("rust: Disallow BTF generation with Rust + LTO")
keeps RUST off when LTO and DEBUG_INFO_BTF are both enabled. Our default
kernel is built with Clang ThinLTO and needs BTF for sched_ext and the
BPF tooling, so olddefconfig silently drops RUST, and with it the Rust
abstractions and the DRM panic QR code.

With pahole 1.32, the BTF of a ThinLTO vmlinux with Rust built in is
fine. Rust modules are what fails: when pahole merges the CUs of an LTO
object, the merged CU takes the language of the first CU, which is the
Rust one for Rust modules. --lang_exclude=rust then drops the whole
merged CU, and gen-btf.sh fails:

  FAILED: load BTF from samples/rust/rust_minimal.ko.BTF.1: No such file or directory

This is fixed in pahole by the series "dwarf_loader: Fix --lang_exclude
on merged CUs", which is not in a release yet and does not bump the
version, so the dependency cannot be gated on PAHOLE_VERSION. Drop the
!LTO part of it and build with a pahole that carries these fixes.

Tested with Clang 23 and rustc 1.99 on x86_64 ThinLTO with DWARF 5,
DEBUG_INFO_BTF_MODULES and MODULE_ALLOW_BTF_MISMATCH=n: the vmlinux and
C module BTF are the same as with stock pahole, the Rust sample modules
and rnull get BTF and load, and scx_bpfland and scx_cosmos attach.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20261010005227.976-1-linux@alanderk.com/
Signed-off-by: Peter Jung <admin@ptr1337.dev>
---
 init/Kconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/init/Kconfig b/init/Kconfig
index 2ef6b3b35c2e20..c3171b072cda70 100644
--- a/init/Kconfig
+++ b/init/Kconfig
@@ -2280,7 +2280,7 @@ config RUST
 	depends on !MODVERSIONS || GENDWARFKSYMS
 	depends on !GCC_PLUGIN_RANDSTRUCT
 	depends on !RANDSTRUCT
-	depends on !DEBUG_INFO_BTF || (PAHOLE_HAS_LANG_EXCLUDE && !LTO)
+	depends on !DEBUG_INFO_BTF || PAHOLE_HAS_LANG_EXCLUDE
 	depends on !CFI || HAVE_CFI_ICALL_NORMALIZE_INTEGERS_RUSTC
 	select CFI_ICALL_NORMALIZE_INTEGERS if CFI
 	depends on !KASAN || CC_IS_CLANG
